        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「Pretty Dreadful」 is a story driven point&amp;click adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Re:do had big dreams and goals he tried to achieve in a big city. However, having graduated, he realized that he doesn’t know what to do with his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he cannot remember a thing from his own past, Re:do believes he is a regular guy who is destined to have a regular life. Yet, no one can run away from their past, even from the forgotten one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granny unexpectedly sends a farewell letter. A strange but familiar two-tailed fox visits Re:do in his dreams. Creepy creatures start walking among people but no one seems to notice them. Re:do has to remember who he was and who he is. And his destiny is not what he thought it would be at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven adventure game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretty anime-like art-style with a bit of creepiness. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles meant to complete the gameplay without challenging your skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe of old Japan from the 90-s. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery that is yet to be revealed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several endings.</p></li></ul>",
